{"id": "tx-gen-001", "dimension": "text", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "格式遵循的最小硬约束：「恰好三条要点」是 App 摘要卡片的真实排版要求，行数用锚定正则程序化判定，模型爱多写一句总结正是生产日志里的高频失格"}, "task": {"user": "用三条要点概括下面这段话。每条一行，以「- 」开头，恰好三条，不要标题、不要编号、不要额外说明。\n\n段落：城市图书馆本月起延长开放时间，周一至周五闭馆时间由 18 点推迟到 21 点。周末维持原时段。同时新增了三十个自习座位，需要提前一天在小程序上预约。"}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_all": ["(?s)^\\s*(?:[-•][ \\t]*[^\\n]+\\n){2}[-•]\\s*[^\\n]+\\s*$"]}}}
{"id": "tx-gen-002", "dimension": "text", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "JSON-only output with fixed keys and a numeric value: the app renders structured replies directly, and a stray code fence or a stringified number breaks the consumer — both are asserted here"}, "task": {"user": "Reply with a single JSON object and nothing else. It must have exactly the keys \"name\", \"city\" and \"age\". Set name to Ada, city to Berlin, and age to the number 30. Do not wrap it in a code fence and do not add any explanation."}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_all": ["\"name\"\\s*:\\s*\"Ada\"", "\"city\"\\s*:\\s*\"Berlin\"", "\"age\"\\s*:\\s*30\\s*[,}]"], "must_not": ["```"]}}}
{"id": "tx-gen-003", "dimension": "text", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "Markdown 表格的表头固定 + 行数固定 + 行序固定：自家回复里表格是常用载体，三项约束同时成立才算过，用整体形状正则钉死，子串断言钉不住行数"}, "task": {"user": "把下面三条记录整理成一个 Markdown 表格，只输出表格本身。表头必须是 `| 城市 | 人口 |`，表头下面是一行分隔行，再往下恰好三行数据，顺序与给出的顺序一致。\n\n记录：大阪 275 万人；名古屋 232 万人；福冈 163 万人。"}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_all": ["(?m)^\\|\\s*城市\\s*\\|\\s*人口\\s*\\|\\s*$", "(?s)^\\s*\\|[^\\n]*\\|[ \\t]*\\n\\|[-\\s:|]+\\|[ \\t]*\\n(?:\\|[^\\n]*\\|[ \\t]*\\n){2}\\|[^\\n]*\\|[ \\t]*\\s*$", "(?s)\\|\\s*大阪\\s*\\|\\s*275[^\\n]*\\|.*\\|\\s*名古屋\\s*\\|\\s*232[^\\n]*\\|.*\\|\\s*福冈\\s*\\|\\s*163[^\\n]*\\|"]}}}
{"id": "tx-gen-004", "dimension": "text", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "One-word answer: the hardest simple instruction for chatty models, and the app's quick-answer chip needs exactly this shape; the anchored regex rejects any wrapping sentence"}, "task": {"user": "What is the capital city of Japan? Answer with exactly one word and nothing else — no punctuation, no sentence."}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_all": ["(?i)^\\s*Tokyo\\s*$"]}}, "gen": {"max_tokens": 1600}}
