{"id": "tx-gen-011", "dimension": "text", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "中译英同时保号保专名：翻译类请求里数字与专有名词被改写或音译是常见的静默错误，用数字词边界与专名正则各钉一条，并要求译文不含汉字"}, "task": {"user": "把下面这句中文翻译成英文，只输出译文，不要任何解释。译文里必须保留数字 3，地名「京都」译作 Kyoto。\n\n原句：我们在京都待了 3 天，主要在清水寺附近活动。"}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_all": ["\\b3\\b", "(?i)\\bKyoto\\b", "^[^一-鿿。、！？，：]*$"]}}, "gen": {"max_tokens": 1600}}
{"id": "tx-gen-012", "dimension": "text", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "List to ordered list with order preserved: reordering is the silent failure mode here, so the assertion is one ordered regex rather than four independent substring checks"}, "task": {"user": "Convert the shopping list below into a numbered list using 1. 2. 3. 4., keeping the original order. Output only the list.\n\napples\nbread\nmilk\neggs"}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_all": ["(?is)1\\.\\s*apples.*2\\.\\s*bread.*3\\.\\s*milk.*4\\.\\s*eggs"]}}}
{"id": "tx-gen-013", "dimension": "text", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "Tone change while three product names survive verbatim: rewriting requests routinely mangle proper nouns, and the polite-marker check keeps the tone requirement rule-checkable without a judge"}, "task": {"user": "Rewrite the internal note below as a polite, formal message to a customer. Keep all three product names exactly as written: Nimbus Router, Vertex Hub, Orion Cable.\n\nNote: your Nimbus Router order shipped, the Vertex Hub is delayed, and we're out of Orion Cable."}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"must_all": ["Nimbus Router", "Vertex Hub", "Orion Cable"], "must_any": ["Dear", "Thank you", "thank you", "We apologize", "we apologize", "apologise", "Please", "please", "Sincerely", "sincerely", "regret", "Regret", "Kindly", "kindly"]}}}
