{"id": "tx-gen-016", "dimension": "text", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "Pick the right date out of three in a contract note: date confusion is a measurable failure and the two other dates are asserted absent, so guessing the first date in the text fails"}, "task": {"user": "From the notes below, reply with ONLY the date of the on-site inspection, written exactly as it appears in the text. No other words.\n\nNotes: The contract was signed on 2026-01-14 and the equipment shipped on 2026-02-02. The on-site inspection is scheduled for 2026-03-19. Payment is due 30 days after the inspection."}, "expect": {"type": "text", "final": {"regex_all": ["\\b2026-03-19\\b"], "must_not": ["2026-01-14", "2026-02-02"]}}, "gen": {"max_tokens": 1600}}
